---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE, CONTACT, BUSINESS } from '../lib/config';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — SK Immigration Services"
  description="Terms of Service for SK Immigration Services (SMC-Private) Limited. No visa guarantees policy, fee structure, limitation of liability, and service conditions."
  canonicalUrl={`${SITE.url}/terms/`}
>
  <section class="bg-navy-900 py-12">
    <div class="container-sk text-center">
      <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-white">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-slate-400 text-sm">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-pad bg-white dark:bg-navy-900">
    <div class="container-sk">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto content-prose">
        <div class="rounded-xl bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-700/50 p-5 mb-8">
          <p class="text-sm text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-300 font-medium">
            ⚠️ <strong>Important:</strong> SK Immigration Services does not guarantee visa outcomes. All visa decisions are made exclusively by embassies, consulates, VFS Global, and immigration authorities. Please read these terms carefully before engaging our services.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2>1. About the Company</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms of Service govern the use of services provided by <strong>SK Immigration Services (SMC-Private) Limited</strong>
          (CUIN {BUSINESS.cuin}), incorporated in Pakistan and operating from Office No. 10, Alfazal Plaza 64C, Satellite Town, Rawalpindi, Punjab, Pakistan.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Nature of Services</h2>
        <p>SK Immigration Services provides:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Immigration file preparation and documentation assistance</li>
          <li>Educational guidance on visa categories and eligibility requirements</li>
          <li>University and employer admission assistance</li>
          <li>Document attestation coordination</li>
          <li>Visa appointment booking assistance</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          We are an <strong>immigration consultancy</strong>, not a legal firm. We do not provide legal representation in immigration courts or tribunals.
        </p>

        <h2>3. No Visa Guarantee Policy</h2>
        <p>
          SK Immigration Services explicitly does <strong>not</strong> guarantee, promise, or imply any specific visa outcome.
          Final decisions on all visa and immigration applications rest solely with the relevant embassy, consulate, high commission,
          immigration authority, or government body of the destination country.
        </p>
        <p>
          Any agent, consultant, or company that guarantees a visa approval is misrepresenting the immigration process.
          We strongly advise clients to be wary of such claims from any service provider.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Fee Policy</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>All consultancy fees are communicated in writing before any payment is made</li>
          <li>Government fees (BEOE, Enjaz, VFS, embassy fees, medical) are paid directly to the respective authority and are separate from our consultancy fee</li>
          <li>Our consultancy fee is non-refundable once file preparation has commenced, unless we are unable to begin the service</li>
          <li>A visa refusal does not automatically entitle the client to a fee refund, as our service is file preparation — not visa approval</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Client Responsibilities</h2>
        <p>Clients must:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide accurate, complete, and truthful information and documents</li>
          <li>Respond promptly to requests for additional documents or information</li>
          <li>Attend all scheduled appointments on time</li>
          <li>Not misrepresent their profile, finances, or intentions to any embassy or authority</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Providing false documents or information is illegal and may result in permanent visa bans. SK Immigration Services will immediately cease services if fraud or misrepresentation is discovered.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the maximum extent permitted by Pakistani law, SK Immigration Services shall not be liable for:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Visa refusals by any embassy or immigration authority</li>
          <li>Changes in embassy requirements, immigration rules, or policies</li>
          <li>Delays caused by government processing times</li>
          <li>Any indirect, consequential, or special losses arising from our services</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>7. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan.
          Any disputes shall be subject to the jurisdiction of the courts of Rawalpindi, Punjab, Pakistan.
        </p>

        <h2>8. Website Content Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          The guides and blog posts on this website are for <strong>educational purposes only</strong>.
          Embassy requirements, fees, and procedures change frequently. Always verify current requirements from official embassy websites.
          SK Immigration Services is not liable for decisions made based solely on website content without consulting our advisors.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          For any questions regarding these terms: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a><br />
          WhatsApp: <a href={`tel:${CONTACT.phone}`}>{CONTACT.phoneFormatted}</a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
